{{also|állás}}
==Finnish==

===Etymology===
A {{etyl|gem|fi}} loan, compare Proto-Germanic {{m|gem-pro|*aldōn}} (whence eg. Norwegian {{term|olda|lang=no}}). The ending has probably been modified to {{term|-as|lang=fi}} by analogy with other Germanic loans (such as {{term|valas|lang=fi}}). Karelian {{term|allaš||trough|lang=krl}} is of the same origin.

